 to  come across but he also does have a  weakness and it seems to be his very own  arrogance which blinds his focus with  that Trigon would be a fun character to  cosplay check out the human version of  Trigon on the right this guy made it  seem that recreating a demonic character  with horns six eyes and a red body is  super easy and he's even joined by the  real-life version of his daughter whom  we will talk about next raven and he or  she is one of the most popular  characters of the whole series do you  agree with this statement let us know in  the comments who you think deserves to  be the most popular Teen Titans  character Raven trigons daughter is one  of the most interesting characters ever  she's trying to control the negativity  she got from her father but in the end  she's still on the team of these young  superheroes Raven often comes across as  sarcastic and mysterious but she stands  up for what she believes in and doesn't  give in to what her father wants to make  of her life her character is such a  popular role model you can find plenty  of Raven related cosplayers out there  but this is one of the best we've  discovered this cosplayers nickname is  sim rel and her cosplay as Raven went  viral on reddit she looks perfect in her  mysterious blue cloak blue hair and a  black outfit check out this person that  got a very awesome looking raven tattoo  what do you like or dislike about Raven  make sure you let us know in the  comments below we'd love to see your  opinion  and of this weedy character that made us  laugh out loud with her sarcasm  Blackfyre beast boy  cyborg Robin Starfire and Raven are the  main characters of Teen Titans go  but now let's have a look at some of the  characters who also deserve mentioned  Blackfyre is Starfire sister who appears  in the show for just a brief moment but  she is otherwise quite present in the DC  comics world as her name suggests  Blackfyre is a total opposite from her  sister she has long dark purple hair and  much darker although her outfit is  equally as cool her powers include super  strength stamina durability and just  like her sister she can also project  energy from her hands for a character  that doesn't really have such good  intentions as Starfire does she sounds  pretty cool  in fact she's so cool some people  decided to try out dressing up as black  fire in real life this deviantART user  is called Chi Sakai and we believe her  black fire cosplay might just be the  best one yet  check out that long purple hair and  fancy outfit that could very well look  like the real deal black fire gets her  sister in trouble on a regular basis if  you're a fan of the series you probably  remember when she dressed up Starfire as  herself pretending she wants to be her  twin  in reality this little act got Starfire  into huge trouble she means business and  so does this awesome cosplayer Tara Tara  briefly appears on a Teen Titans go  episode called terrorized that's similar  to the original plot of Teen Titans Tara  is a Latin name for land and this is why  Tara holds powers that allow her to  control the earth and minerals she turns  out to be a pretty tough character in  the DC Comics who's even able to survive  being immersed in lava her storyline  changes in every series and during her  brief appearance in Teen Titans go she  pretends to be romantic  involved with Beast Boy to get to the  team's secret files her looks make her a  pretty fun character to cosplay this  cosplayer goes by the nickname of Alice  in the TARDIS and she did a fantastic  job at portraying what Terra might look  like in real life Terra has long blonde  hair a black top yellow shorts and brown  boots in teen titans Terra raises a lot  of fan theories that she was a very  misunderstood character who didn't know  how to make friends and just wanted a  place to belong she's probably one of  the least favourite characters on the  show but that doesn't mean that she  doesn't have fans who want to recreate  her looks in real life well Terra wasn't  the only character people have mixed  feelings about Ravager much like Terra  Blackfyre and Batman  Ravinder is just a minor character in  Teen Titans go but she comes with such  an iconic look we just had to add her to  this list  Ravinder is one of our favorite  characters from the series and although  she has a minor part in Teen Titans go  she's one of the most powerful  characters ever her real name is Rose  Wilson and she's a martial arts expert  who's also skilled at combat she has  many enhanced abilities that make her a  super soldier and she has the incredible  power of precognition which allows her  to predict the moves of her opponents  her unique look consists of long white  hair an eyepatch covering one of her  eyes and an orange black and blue outfit  a cosplayer who goes by the name of  Megan Coffey did an amazing job at  recreating a real-life Ravager  check out this excellent picture of her  holding to fire swords like a complete  pro what do you think does this compare  to the DC Comics version Ravager might  not be a very lovable character and  while she might not be on the good side  she is hilarious  with her witty remarks and sarcasm  Batman alright alright  we can't talk about Teen Titans without  mentioning Batman can we he's very close  to  robbing but he very briefly makes a few  appearances in Teen Titans go one of the  episodes includes him getting tied in  the face by Robin Batman is a very  fascinating character and one of the  most popular DC Comics superheroes ever  you can probably imagine how many Batman  cosplayers are out there right but  there's only one that was able to set an  incredible cosplay record  the Guinness gamers edition 2017 showed  off a unique Batman cosplay suit made by  an Irish special creature effects expert  Julian check Lee this amazing suit  consists of 23 brilliant gadgets that  include video screens projectors a UV  lamp bat cams and more here's an even